# Cursor Adapter (PineGuard) — Legacy

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This file is a legacy pointer stub.**
> Cursor's current rules format is **`.cursor/rules/*.mdc`**, which is authoritative and
> path-scoped. This root file is retained only for older Cursor builds. Do not grow it back:
> see `docs/ai/meta/adapter-surfaces.md` §3.1.

